h2>精英大學是卡特爾：賣的是身份，不是教育</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國精英大學不是慈善教育機構，而是靠凍結招生規模、運營校友捐贈和承接聯邦研究撥款來維持品牌的卡特爾；它們賣的是身份，不是教育。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大學財政</span><span class=\"tag\">捐贈基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\"\n data-hay=\"噬菌體靠10,000倍回覆突變下注，EBV人源化抗體首現 噬菌體通過 SSR 的 10,000 倍回覆突變實現賭注對沖，EBV 人源化抗體在體內阻止腫瘤，疫苗多路線推進。 This Week in Virology This Week in Virology TWiV 1353: Phage bet-hedging and EBV antibodies 噬菌體 賭注 hedging EBV 抗體 疫苗 認知懶惰 SSR bet-hedging contingency locus hybridoma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-twiv-噬菌體用隨機突變下注-ebv人類抗體首次成功/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:52:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>噬菌體靠10,000倍回覆突變下注，EBV人源化抗體首現</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">噬菌體通過 SSR 的 10,000 倍回覆突變實現賭注對沖，EBV 人源化抗體在體內阻止腫瘤，疫苗多路線推進。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">噬菌體</span><span class=\"tag\">賭注 hedging</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\"\n data-hay=\"噬菌體靠複製打滑預留變異，賭細菌防禦會升級 打滑不是複製故障，而是噬菌體的一種對沖：群體裡常有少數個體因重複序列改變讀碼框，生成還沒被選中的變異。平時多數適應當下環境，細菌防禦一升級，低頻備選立刻接管。 This Week in Virology This Week in Virology TWiV 1353: Phage bet-hedging and EBV antibodies 噬菌體 賭注對沖 EBV 單克隆抗體 疫苗設計 科學傳播 simple sequence repeats (SSR) bet-hedging hybridoma HAT medium humanized mice\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-twiv-噬菌體靠複製打滑預留變異-賭細菌防禦會升級/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<s